# Security

- Never commit secrets (`.env`, keys, service account JSON, PEM files).
- Never add long-lived GCP service account keys to GitHub Actions — use OIDC/WIF per docs/setup/github-google-oidc.md.
- Do not log API keys, tokens, or unnecessary PII.
- Do not point local dev at production Firestore or production secrets.
- Do not disable CI security checks to "make it pass" without team agreement.
- Production config changes require explicit review.
